\title{ssdiff: Supervised Semantic Differential}
\description{
Interpretable, embedding-based analysis of concept meaning in text. Builds per-document concept vectors from local contexts around seed words, learns a semantic gradient that predicts a numeric outcome or separates groups, and interprets it through the nearest neighbours of each pole, clusters of those neighbours, text snippets and per-document scores. The method is described in Plisiecki, Lenartowicz, Pokropek, Małyska and Flakus (2025) \doi{10.31234/osf.io/gvrsb_v1}. A port of the 'Python' package 'ssdiff'.
